00001|T|FADE IN -- Title:
00002|O|
00003|U|For nearly forty years this story has given faithful service
00004|N|to the Young in Heart; and Time has been powerless to put its
00005|N|kindly philosophy out of fashion.
00006|O|
00007|N|To those of you who have been faithful to it in return
00008|O|
00009|N|...and to the Young in Heart --- we dedicate this picture.
00010|O|
